WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.229
LOOK. A school tree stands beside a stone and a desk.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.613
OBSERVE. See green leaves, a grey stone and a brown desk.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.034
SORT. Put tree in the living group; stone and desk in non-living.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:16.323
SHOW. Describe one colour, shape or texture for each item.
